UPDATE companies SET description='Lava Textiles, a Belgian family-owned knitting company, traces its roots to 1925 in Belgium. The firm expanded to the United States in 2007, establishing its American headquarters in York, South Carolina. Still under family ownership, the company operates production facilities across five countries: Belgium (1925), the United States (2007), Romania (2011), Indonesia (2018), and Mexico (2021).

The company specializes in knitted fabrics, combining decades of technical experience with state-of-the-art machinery.

Its fabrics are designed to add value through innovative design and consistent quality.

