UPDATE companies SET description='LCS Precision Molding operates from Waterville, Minnesota, where it has provided custom plastic injection molding for more than 50 years. The company began as a small molding operation created to meet a specific customer need and grew from a single machine into a full-service manufacturer with 15 presses and end-to-end project support.

The facility runs 15 injection molding presses ranging from 22 to 400 tons with shot capacities up to 27 ounces. In-house engineering assists with part design, resin selection, and design-for-manufacturing feedback, while mold development is coordinated through domestic and international tooling partners. Secondary operations include assembly, custom packaging, kitting, inventory stocking programs, and specialized shipping. The company handles both short-run orders and long-term production programs.

LCS serves industries including fenestration (window and door components), motorsports, recreational products, furniture, electronics (housings and precision parts), water filtration, retail infrastructure, and specialized industrial applications.

The company emphasizes a single-partner model that spans concept through delivery, backed by ISO 9001:2015 certification and an on-time delivery record exceeding 95 percent. Personalized project management, flexible production scheduling, and U.S.-based manufacturing with access to global tooling resources are cited as key differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom plastic injection molding", "Engineering and design support", "Design for manufacturing (DFM) feedback", "Resin selection assistance", "Mold development and maintenance", "Secondary operations: assembly, packaging, kitting", "Inventory stocking programs", "Specialized shipping and logistics", "Real-time ERP production tracking", "Short-run and long-term production programs"], "industries": ["Fenestration", "Motorsports", "Recreational Products", "Furniture", "Electronics", "Water Filtration", "Retail Infrastructure", "Specialized Industrial Applications"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["15 injection molding presses (22\u2013400 ton capacity)", "Shot capacity up to 27 ounces"], "volume": "Short production runs to long-term manufacturing programs", "lead_time": "Under 5 weeks average build-to-order lead time", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Single-partner support from design through delivery", "ISO 9001:2015 certified quality system", "On-time delivery rate above 95%", "15 presses (22\u2013400 ton) for flexible short- and long-run production", "U.S.-based manufacturing with domestic and international tooling options"], "facts_used": ["Location: Waterville, Minnesota -> /about-us", "More than 50 years of injection molding experience -> /", "Started as small molding operation to meet customer need -> /about-us", "15 injection molding presses, 22-400 ton capacity -> /", "Shot sizes up to 27 ounces -> /", "Engineering support: part design, resin selection, DFM -> /", "Mold development via domestic and international partners -> /", "Secondary operations