UPDATE companies SET description='Lectronix Inc is headquartered in Lansing, Michigan, with satellite engineering offices in Ann Arbor and Grand Rapids. The company operates as a U.S.-based contract electronics manufacturer providing turnkey hardware and software solutions.

Lectronix delivers end-to-end electronics manufacturing and product development, encompassing PCB assembly, system integration, functional testing, and full product assembly. Its capabilities extend to hardware engineering, embedded software development, mechanical design, and rapid prototyping, all housed under one roof. The company supports scalable production from low to high volumes, serving high-reliability sectors with disciplined process control and rigorous validation.

The company serves Tier 1 automotive suppliers, global OEMs, and regional customers across automotive, transportation, public safety, industrial automation, networking and telecommunications, robotics, and select medical applications. Notable products include rugged Android displays and vehicle controllers for police and public safety fleets.

Lectronix differentiates itself through an integrated turnkey model that aligns engineering, manufacturing, and supply chain management within a single organization. This approach reduces vendor handoffs, accelerates time-to-market, and maintains traceability for mission-critical applications. The company emphasizes design for manufacturability, thorough validation, and long-term life-cycle support to minimize field failures.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["PCB assembly", "System integration", "Functional testing", "Product assembly", "Hardware engineering", "Embedded software development", "Mechanical design", "Rapid prototyping", "Embedded systems development", "Ruggedized electronics design", "Mission-critical application engineering", "Design for manufacturability (DFM)", "Validation testing", "Supply chain management", "Component sourcing", "Life cycle support", "New product introduction (NPI)"], "industries": ["Automotive", "Transportation", "Public safety", "Industrial automation", "Networking", "Telecommunications", "Robotics", "Medical"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "Low to high volume", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Turnkey electronics manufacturing with engineering and production under one roof", "U.S.-based manufacturing backed by a global supply base", "Integrated model reducing vendor handoffs and accelerating time-to-market", "Scalable production from low to high volumes for high-reliability industries", "Specialized expertise in ruggedized, mission-critical electronics for automotive and public safety"], "facts_used": ["Headquartered in Lansing, Michigan with satellite offices in Ann Arbor and Grand Rapids -> /", "Provides turnkey hardware and software for automotive, transportation, public safety -> /", "Offers PCB assembly, system integration, functional testing, product assembly -> /", "Provides hardware engineering, embedded software, mechanical design, prototyping -> /", "Supports 