UPDATE companies SET description='Logix, LLC was founded in 2015 in Belfast, Maine, by Josh and Rachele as a family‑owned solar and heat‑pump installation business originally named SolarLogix. The company rebranded to Logix as its service lines expanded beyond solar to cover a broader range of electrification technologies.

A crew of roughly 35 technicians serves residential and commercial customers across central and eastern Maine, handling everything from initial design and incentive paperwork to ongoing maintenance.

The client base spans homeowners looking to cut utility bills and businesses seeking to decarbonize operations.

