UPDATE companies SET description='The company''s founding year and ownership structure are not publicly disclosed on its website. The business presents itself as a molding specialist with an integrated tooling capability.

The shop runs compression molding and custom plastic injection molding, including over molding and insert molding. It bonds high-performance polymers such as PTFE, HNBR, and Kevlar® to metal components. The same machine shop handles insert molding for bonding projects.

The company does not list specific industry verticals or named customers on its site. Its materials portfolio centers on wear- and temperature-resistant polymers for applications that demand durability.

