UPDATE companies SET description='Long Leaf Wood Shop operates from Montgomery, Alabama, where it was founded in 2019. The business began as a member-based woodworking space offering classes and community events, driven by a vision to provide a place where both experienced and novice woodworkers could create in a safe, fun environment.

