UPDATE companies SET description='Louisiana Structured Cabling, LLC was founded in 1986 in Lake Charles, Louisiana. The company was started by Matthew Theriot, who serves as president and brings over 40 years of experience designing and installing custom cabling solutions for industrial and commercial clients across the United States.

The firm specializes in the design and installation of structured cabling systems. Its service portfolio includes fiber optic backbone cabling and precision splicing, Category 6 and 6A copper cabling, conduit boring and installation, core drilling for vertical and horizontal cable paths, communication room design and installation, as well as camera, CCTV, and TV/monitor installation for high-security commercial and industrial facilities. The company operates under a Louisiana state license (#62337) and holds memberships with BICSI, ISNetworld, and DISA.

Its client base spans industries that require mission-critical data infrastructure and surveillance systems.

The company differentiates itself with a lifetime guarantee on all new horizontal cabling installations, NDAA compliance, and a stated personal commitment to Louisiana''s growth. Membership in BICSI, ISNetworld, and DISA underscores its adherence to industry standards and security requirements.', certifications=ARRAY['BICSI Member','ISNetworld Member','DISA Member','NDAA Compliant','Louisiana State License #62337']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Camera Installation", "Communication Room Design", "Communication Room Installation", "Conduit Boring", "Conduit Installation", "TV/Monitor Installation", "Core Drilling", "Fiber Optic Cabling and Splicing", "CCTV Systems", "Category 6/6A Structured Cabling"], "industries": ["Commercial", "Industrial"], "materials": ["Fiber optic cable", "Copper cable", "Category 6A cable", "Category 6 cable", "Conduit"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Lifetime guarantee on new horizontal cabling installations", "BICSI member", "ISNetworld member", "DISA member", "NDAA compliant"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1986 -> db", "Headquarters in Lake Charles, Louisiana -> db", "Founder and president Matthew Theriot with over 40 years experience -> /", "Services: fiber optic and category cabling, conduit boring, core drilling, communication room design/installation, camera/CCTV/TV installation -> /", "Lifetime guarantee on new horizontal cabling installations -> /", "BICSI Member -> /", "ISNetworld Member -> /", "DISA Member -> /", "Louisiana State License #62337 -> /", "NDAA Compliant -> /", "Serves commercial and industrial businesses across Louisiana -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Louisiana Structured Cabling (LASC) provides fiber optic and category cabling services for businesses and industries across Louisiana.", "founded_year": "1986", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": ["NDAA Complia