UPDATE companies SET description='MEMC LLC, operating as GlobalWafers, is headquartered in St. Peters, Missouri. The company traces its origins to 1959, when it began pioneering the design and development of wafer technologies for the semiconductor industry.

The company manufactures silicon wafers that serve as the foundation for integrated circuits. Its processes include epitaxial deposition, silicon-on-insulator (SOI) wafer production, gettering, hydrogen annealing, nitrogen doping, and the proprietary Magic Denuded Zone (MDZ) technology. Manufacturing facilities operate in the United States, Europe, and Asia Pacific, with sites in St. Peters (MO), Chonan (South Korea), Hsin-Chu (Taiwan), Kuala Lumpur (Malaysia), Utsunomiya (Japan), Merano (Italy), and Novara (Italy).

GlobalWafers supplies semiconductor device manufacturers and states it serves 100 percent of the top 25 customers in the semiconductor industry. Its wafers are used in computers, smart phones, televisions, gaming devices, music players, appliances, automobiles, and industrial and space applications.

The company says its strategy is to be the preferred supplier through innovative products and differentiated service that leverage its manufacturing and R&D strengths. It emphasizes uncompromising quality and efficient production methods, working closely with customers to understand exacting specifications and anticipate future parametrics.', certifications=ARRAY['IATF 16949','IATF 16949:2016','ISO 9001:2015','ISO 9002']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Silicon wafer manufacturing", "Epitaxial deposition", "Silicon-on-insulator (SOI) wafer production", "Gettering processes", "Hydrogen annealing", "Nitrogen doping", "Magic Denuded Zone (MDZ) technology", "Custom EPI products", "High quality factor passive component integration", "RF/analog component isolation from digital CMOS"], "industries": ["Semiconductor", "Electronics", "Computers", "Smart phones", "Televisions", "Gaming devices", "Appliances", "Automotive", "Industrial", "Space"], "materials": ["Silicon"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Serves 100% of the top 25 semiconductor customers", "Innovative products and differentiated service leveraging manufacturing and R&D strengths", "Uncompromising quality and efficient production methods", "Close customer collaboration to understand specifications and anticipate future needs"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters St. Peters, Missouri -> db", "Founded 1959 -> homepage", "Manufactures silicon wafers for semiconductor industry -> homepage", "Facilities in US, Europe, Asia Pacific -> homepage", "Serves 100% of top 25 semiconductor customers -> homepage", "Applications: computers, smart phones, TVs, gaming, appliances, automotive, industrial, space -> homepage", "Processes: epitaxial deposition, SOI, gettering, hydrogen annealing, nitrogen doping, MDZ -> homepage, products list", "Certifications: IATF 16949, ISO 9001:2015, ISO 9002 -> quality page", "Quality awards: Missouri Quality Award 1994, Industry Week 1995, Missouri