UPDATE companies SET description='MFG Supply operates from Medford, Wisconsin, where it was founded in 1963 as Manufacturer''s Supply, a family-owned mail-order catalog for small engine parts. The business remains in the hands of the founding family, now in its third generation, and launched its e-commerce site in 1996 to serve customers worldwide.

The company stocks more than 21,000 parts in its warehouse, covering snowmobiles, ATVs, go-karts, mini bikes, lawnmowers, chainsaws, snowblowers, trimmers, motorcycles, trailers, and personal watercraft. Its inventory spans clutches, belts, electrical components, suspension and drive parts, carburetor and fuel-system components, and a range of replacement hardware for small-engine equipment.

The catalog is organized by vehicle type and system, allowing buyers to locate specific components such as CDI boxes, voltage regulators, drive sprockets, and track parts.

