UPDATE companies SET description='Madden Fabrication operates from Portland, Oregon, where it was founded in 1992 as a division of a parent company.

The shop occupies 18,000 square feet and runs CNC plasma cutting, 120-ton and 50-ton ironworkers, a programmable draw bender, and a full suite of welding processes including GMAW, FCAW, GTAW, SMAW, and SAW. Design work is handled in-house with AutoCAD and SolidWorks. The company works with carbon steel, structural steel, stainless steel, aluminum, nickel alloys, and exotic metals, producing structural, architectural, and ornamental metal fabrications. It also provides field installation and repair within a roughly 100-mile radius of Portland.

Madden Fabrication serves industrial, commercial, and residential construction markets. Industrial clients include municipalities, geothermal projects, mills, and chemical plants, where the shop supplies valve and pipe assemblies, precision parts, and safety upgrades. Commercial work covers restaurants, retail spaces, new construction, and remodels, delivering handrails, guardrails, canopies, awnings, and building envelope components. Residential projects range from custom stair railings and balcony guards to gates and ornamental pieces for homeowners and designers. The portfolio also includes bridge components, parking garage structures, and multi-family housing.

The company emphasizes its 30-plus years of experience, adherence to relevant codes and standards, and a quality program developed under American Society of Mechanical Engineers guidelines. Its stated mission is "precision, innovation, excellence," aiming to build lasting client relationships through superior service and dedication to craft.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Structural steel fabrication", "Architectural metal fabrication", "Ornamental metal fabrication", "CNC plasma cutting", "Welding (GMAW, FCAW, GTAW, SMAW, SAW)", "Programmable draw bending", "CAD design (AutoCAD, SolidWorks)", "Field installation and repair"], "industries": ["Industrial construction", "Commercial construction", "Residential construction", "Municipal", "Geothermal", "Mill and chemical plant", "Restaurant and retail", "Parking garage construction", "Bridge construction"], "materials": ["Carbon steel", "Structural steel", "Stainless steel", "Aluminum", "Nickel alloys", "Exotic metals"], "equipment": ["CNC plasma cutting machine", "120-ton ironworker", "50-ton ironworker", "Programmable draw bender"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["18,000 sq ft fabrication and storage facility", "CNC plasma cutting and 120-ton/50-ton ironworkers", "Multiple welding processes (GMAW, FCAW, GTAW, SMAW, SAW)", "In-house design with AutoCAD and SolidWorks", "Installation service within 100-mile radius of Portland"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1992 -> db", "Headquarters Portland, Oregon -> db", "18,000 sq ft facility -> /", "CNC plasma cutting -> /", "120-ton and 50-ton ironworkers -> /", "Welding processes (GMAW, FCAW, GTAW, SMAW, SAW) -> /", "Programmable draw bender -> /", "In-house AutoCAD and SolidWorks -> /", "Materials: carbon steel, structural steel, stainless steel, aluminum, nickel alloys, exotic metals -> /, /about-us", "Structural, architectural, ornamental metal fabrication -> /", "Installation within 100-mile radius -> /", "Industrie