UPDATE companies SET description='Maine Woodworks, based in Saco, Maine, was founded in 1991. The company builds custom-made furniture, emphasizing thoughtful design and craftsmanship.

The company produces a range of residential furniture including bedroom, dining, entryway, office, and occasional pieces. Each item is handcrafted in Maine using regionally sourced sustainable hardwood and traditional joinery such as four-corner English dovetails. Finishes are eco-friendly and inspired by the natural colors of Maine. Production is made-to-order, allowing customers to customize panel styles, leg designs, hardware, and finishes. The workshop also offers assembly services and white-glove delivery scheduling.

Maine Woodworks serves primarily residential customers seeking heirloom-quality pieces for their homes. It also operates a Trade & Hospitality program catering to interior designers, contractors, and hospitality clients such as hotels and inns.

The business was started to create well-made, customizable furniture that fits the way people live. The company highlights its combination of elevated design and exceptional craftsmanship, with a focus on durability—building pieces intended to last for generations. Its differentiators include Maine-based handcrafting, sustainable materials, dovetail joinery, and a made-to-order model with a typical lead time of six to eight weeks.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom furniture manufacturing", "Handcrafted woodworking", "English dovetail joinery", "Custom eco-friendly finishing", "Made-to-order production", "White-glove delivery", "Assembly services", "Trade/Hospitality program"], "industries": ["Residential furniture", "Hospitality", "Trade/Contract"], "materials": ["Sustainable hardwood", "Regionally sourced hardwood"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "6-8 weeks", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Handcrafted in Maine from regionally sourced sustainable hardwood", "Four-corner English dovetail joinery for durability", "Eco-friendly finishes inspired by Maine\u2019s natural beauty", "Made-to-order customization on every piece", "White-glove delivery service with assembly included"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1991 -> db", "Headquarters Saco, Maine -> db", "Custom-made furniture -> db", "Handcrafted in Maine -> /", "Sustainable hardwood -> /", "Four-corner English dovetail joinery -> /", "Eco-friendly finishes -> /", "Made-to-order customization -> /", "White glove delivery service -> /", "Production lead times six to eight weeks -> /", "Trade+Hospitality program -> /", "Assembly included when required -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We build custom-made furniture in Maine\u2014thoughtful, well-made pieces designed to fit your home and your life.", "founded_year": "1991", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_li